<h1 data-copy-en="Kent" data-copy-zh="Kent">Kent</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Storytelling lesson, Charm reward and Inn visits." data-copy-zh="讲故事课程、魅力奖励与旅馆探访。">Storytelling lesson, Charm reward and Inn visits.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Old_Healer.27s_Oath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Old_Healer's_Oath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="An_Arrangement_at_the_Inn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Shared_Character_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Kent — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kent.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kent — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kent.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kent — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Kent teaches Storytelling and offers a one-time Charm increase at the Travelers Inn. These are his practical personal rewards; inn lodging and other visitors’ quests use separate location or character actions.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Traveler's Inn Tavern</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Room_Without_Questions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Storytelling_Wisdom_and_the_Skill_Lesson"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>At Known (25) and Communication 38, take Storytelling Wisdom for Charm +1 and 8 direct affection. For the Storytelling skill itself, reach Acquaintance (50) and Creativity 18, then prepare $300 and 50 Energy for the 150-minute lesson.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Old Healer's Oath</th><td data-label="Requirements">Village Healer's Hut; 08:00–19:00; Amelia Acknowledged (10); Muramasa Friend (100); Kent Acknowledged (10); The Healer's Hut; An Arrangement at the Inn; Muramasa, Kent not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Muramasa +3; Kent +4; Amelia +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Arrangement at the Inn</th><td data-label="Requirements">Traveler's Inn Tavern; 20:00–23:00; Muramasa Known (25); Kent Known (25); The Empty Ring</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Muramasa +3; Kent +3</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Kent</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Traveler's Inn Tavern; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 20/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Storytelling Wisdom</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Traveler's Inn Tavern; Known (25); Communication 38</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 direct affection; Charm +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Storytelling</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Traveler's Inn Tavern; Acquaintance (50); Creativity 18</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">150 min; $300; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 base affection; Storytelling; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Normal Talk takes 15 minutes and awards 1 base affection, up to its normal 20 daily uses. Both lessons are one-time rewards.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before other bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount.</p><p>Charm 40; Communication 35; Perception 50</p><p>Favorite skill: Storytelling</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection and NPC intimacy experience are distinct. Dialogue choices can add rewards beyond the listed event-completion base.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Known is enough for the stat reward, but the skill lesson needs Acquaintance and Creativity 18.</li><li>Already knowing Storytelling removes that lesson; it is not repeatable Charm training.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-muramasa.html">Muramasa</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Storytelling</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Location reference</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story navigation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Old_Healer.27s_Oath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Old_Healer's_Oath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-An_Arrangement_at_the_Inn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Shared_Character_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Kent 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kent.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kent 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kent.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kent 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Kent 在旅人旅店酒馆教授讲故事技能，并提供一次性魅力提升。住宿及其他访客的任务则使用各自的地点或角色行动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">旅人旅店酒馆</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Room_Without_Questions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Storytelling_Wisdom_and_the_Skill_Lesson"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>已知（25）、沟通 38 时，可完成讲故事的智慧，获得魅力 +1 与 8 直接好感度。讲故事技能课程则要求相识（50）、创造力 18，另需 $300、50 精力与 150 分钟。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">老治疗师的誓言</th><td data-label="条件">村庄治疗师小屋; 08:00–19:00; Amelia 已遇见 (10); Muramasa 朋友 (100); Kent 已遇见 (10); 治疗师的小屋; 旅店里的安排; Muramasa, Kent 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Muramasa +3; Kent +4; Amelia +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">旅店里的安排</th><td data-label="条件">旅人旅店酒馆; 20:00–23:00; Muramasa 已知 (25); Kent 已知 (25); 空荡的演武圈</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Muramasa +3; Kent +3</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Kent 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">旅人旅店酒馆; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 20次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">讲故事的智慧</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">旅人旅店酒馆; 已知 (25); 沟通 38</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 直接好感度; 魅力 +1; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">讲故事</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">旅人旅店酒馆; 相识 (50); 创造力 18</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">150 分钟; $300; −50 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+10 基础好感度; 讲故事; 一次性</td></tr></tbody></table><p>常规交谈耗时 15 分钟，增加 1 基础好感度，常规次数为每天 20 次。两项课程均为一次性奖励。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。</p><p>魅力 40; 沟通 35; 感知 50</p><p>偏好技能：讲故事</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择还可能在事件完成基础奖励之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>属性奖励只需已知；技能课程则要相识与创造力 18。</li><li>已会讲故事技能时，课程会隐藏；它不是可重复刷魅力的训练。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="character-muramasa.html">Muramasa</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">讲故事</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">地点参考</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线导航</a></li></ul></section>
